  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added SolidWorks DLLs to NuGet Package.\nAdded support for mocking and unit testing the SolidWorks application.\nAdded interfaces for all major objects.\nAdded SketchPointId.\nAdded getting mates from component.\nAdded Mate Entity.\nAdded a faster way to load plugins and marked SolidPlugin<T> as obsolete since it doesn't work.\nAdded ColorRef helpers methods.\nAdded getting root component and all components from an assembly.\nAdded entering and existing Edit Part mode.\nAdded ways to convert entities between components, views and parts.\nAdded Source Link.\nAdded support for SOLIDWORKS 2026 SP1.1.\nUpdated C# version to C# 13.\nConverted to file-scoped namespaces.\nExpanded the readme.\nRefreshed all tutorials.\nDisabled overwriting add-in title when a custom title is set.\nFixed creating a Command Manager per add-in instead of a static one.\nFixed lingering Tools menus and toolbars by disposing them.\nFixed Component.CleanName for virtual components.\nFixed setting Registry key so the add-in starts up.\nFixed handling MateInPlace.\nFixed logging time in 24 hour mode.",
